Third-party material

Guitario bundles no fonts, sounds or images. At run time it uses a SMuFL music font (Bravura or
Leland, SIL Open Font License 1.1) and Times New Roman/Arial-equivalent text fonts when they are
installed on the computer; they are not distributed with Guitario. Rust dependencies keep their
own licenses (see Cargo.lock and each crate's metadata). The per-file list of bundled assets is in
ATTRIBUTION.md.

